:"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-25T21:54:08-08:00","id":1426204,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt the Bruins fan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1419102-the-cults-of-the-blood-gods-discussion-thread?p=1426202#post1426202\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That might be for the best all around, as the impression is being <i>strongly</i> given that any critical opinion of the work being discussed will result in the ban hammer.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm kind of hoping that people have something to talk about other than how much they hate Oblivion. Maybe the 20+ awesome cults in the book.<br /> <br /> But I admit, if you want to bash a book, maybe the best place isn't the company's website.<br /> <br /> Just Sayin.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-25T22:52:19-08:00","id":1426208,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1419102-the-cults-of-the-blood-gods-discussion-thread?p=1426204#post1426204\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm kind of hoping that people have something to talk about other than how much they hate Oblivion. Maybe the 20+ awesome cults in the book.<br /> <br /> But I admit, if you want to bash a book, maybe the best place isn't the company's website.<br /> <br /> Just Sayin.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I must admit that I was surprised that Obtenebration and Necromancy was merged together, but with both Disciplines drawing the same type of energy from basically the same place, it makes sense that they did that.<br /> <br /> Besides, the only new edition of any current ttrpg that I really would like to bash would be Shadowrun 6th Edition...... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Now that's a ruleset that completely FUBAR.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">R<i>emember, remember, the Fifth of November, the Gunpowder Treason and Plot. I know of no reason why the Gunpowder Treason should ever be forgot.</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> -V for Vendetta</span>","edited":{"userid":997,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/997-japheth","user":"Japheth","date":". 11-26-2020, 01:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/997-japheth","name":"Japheth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar997_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"122"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-25T23:58:00-08:00","id":1426210,"title":"","content":"SR6 is rather nice ^^&quot; then again, I can play the german Version from nice guy Pegasus...<br /> <br /> Back to topic: My favourite from CotBG has to be the church of Caine. As I play a Malkavian catholic Priest with his own 'version' of the Church of Caine. It has a Bit more of catholicism in it. The sacraments are realy cool and helped me to recruit another of my fellow Players in the cult. <br /> <br /> I use the shalimites in the Tokio chronicle I ST as some sort of perverted Budhism (bringing the nothingness of Nirvana to the World). The Fukuoka writeup was a real help with that.<br /> <br /> The only rather.. shallow(?) Cult of the mayor ones would be the children of Michael as they are like some toreador on Steroids","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-26T05:19:01-08:00","id":1426227,"title":"","content":"I especially like The Family Reunion (Dinner?).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">R<i>emember, remember, the Fifth of November, the Gunpowder Treason and Plot. I know of no reason why the Gunpowder Treason should ever be forgot.</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> -V for Vendetta</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/997-japheth","name":"Japheth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar997_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"122"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-26T06:38:21-08:00","id":1426229,"title":"","content":"The combination of Obtenebration and Necromancy surprised me, but did not offend me - and also happened in a different book. I had thought of Obtenebration as closer to chimistry (just the &quot;illusions&quot; are simple and black and shadowy). But connecting it to necromancy works for me. I'm easy that way. I don't have a backers copy, because I'm not a backer, but I'm cautiously optimistic. That said, which of the cults which are arguably the most dangerous and Lovecraftian? That interests me more than some inverted Catholic Church gobbledygook.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-26T06:55:51-08:00","id":1426230,"title":"","content":"Its hard to define the most dangerous as you'd have to ask dangerous to whom. On a most Basic level I'd go with the church of Set, Bahari or Church of Caine. The first two have a long history of building their cult, with the Setites having infiltrated the Anarchs through the Ministry. As far as I see it, the Church of Caine is not the Path of Caine part of e.g. the Sabbath, but could subvert and anex them.<br /> The award for most lovecraftian would go to the Shalimites. I'd argue theres nothing more lovecraftian than Worshipping a Herold/God of nothingness who wants to devour reality itself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26305-takeochan","name":"TakeoChan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-14T06:03:16-08:00","id":1428335,"title":"","content":"Sorry for stupid question, but did clans curse change for those who were embraced before the family reunion?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxp